t 2> 敞开的牛仔外套胸前的特写，焦点清晰地落在 <Subject 4> 的白色立体花朵刺绣和金属花扣上。随着 <Subject 1> 向左转身，敞开的牛仔外套轻微弹起。镜头平滑地向下方移动，扫过外套的蓝色渐变水洗纹理和金属纽扣细节。随后，<Subject 1> 迈步远离镜头，她的背影逐渐融入画面深处。与此同时，摄影机开始缓慢地逆时针旋转，使得画面逐渐过渡为倾斜构图，最终以一个充满动感的动态画面结束整个视频。\n\noverall_soundscape:\n清晰而富有节奏感的脚步声与 Hip-Hop 节拍同步，伴随着角色转身时牛仔面料发出的轻微摩擦声。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n一首充满活力的 Hip-Hop 背景音乐，以重低音鼓点和清晰的 Hi-hat 节奏为主，整体节奏明快且富有律动感，为视频营造出强烈的街头时尚氛围。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "自己输入调整后的提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [285.80975341796875, 5381.81591796875], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [892.0082199218301, -4554.785709814816], "scale": 0.7247295000000008}, "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "xzgGroups": {}, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0"}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "User Inputs", "bounding": [-335.4580078125, 5285.541015625, 1208.9503173828125, 834.4500122070312]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Models", "bounding": [-336.1529846191406, 4593.880859375, 700, 674]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Sampling", "bounding": [1247.8470458984375, 4593.880859375, 659, 674]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Conditioning", "bounding": [387.3760070800781, 4591.11669921875, 480, 674]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "pre